# Powerslide, let go, powerslide: a slide does not link to the slide just before it (each banks).
# Down the lab hill at 8 m/s, four slides of 31 ticks two ticks apart: four FS Powerslides of 131,
# each its own combo. (They used to chain risk-free, FS Powerslide x N with a multiplier each.)
park lab
spawn lab_hill_ten
cmd 30 speed 8
hold slide 66..97
hold slide 99..130
hold slide 132..163
hold slide 165..196
run 400
expect event comboLanded{name=FS Powerslide,points=131,multiplier=1} count == 4
expect event comboLanded{name=FS Powerslide} within 99..101
expect event comboLanded{name=FS Powerslide} within 206..210
expect no event bail
